==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Esperanto ''[[ki-]]'' (interrogative and relative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix) + ''[[-a]]'' (correlative suffix of kind)

===Correlative===
{{rfc-header|Correlative}}
'''kia''' (''plural'' '''[[kiaj]]''', ''accusative singular'' '''[[kian]]''', ''accusative plural'' '''[[kiajn]]''')

# what kind of, which kind of (the interrogative and relative correlative of kind)
#: Like other interrogative and relative correlatives, '''kia''' can be combined with ''[[ajn]]'', the adverbial particle of generality. '''''Kia''' ajn'' thus means ''whatever kind of''.

